# zh catalog sheets

Translations are `extracted/catalog/*.csv` (no combined translation_catalog.csv).
Do not Grep or StrReplace that directory. Do not Read dic/dungeon/egg/generals
or other large sheets. Chapter `ch01_sun.csv`…`ch08_ear.csv` and `INDEX.txt`
may be Read one at a time.

```
python3 tools/catalog_query.py get <id>
python3 tools/catalog_query.py prefix <id-prefix>
python3 tools/catalog_query.py search --sheet ch01_sun --zh <substr>
python3 tools/catalog_query.py set <id> --zh '译文'
```

Follow `.cursor/skills/read-zh-catalog/SKILL.md`. Also do not Read `*.iso`,
`eeMemory.bin`, or full PCSX2 PNG screenshots.
